     A*                                     D0702A - "JUCLST4, JUCSRV
     A*                                     version" (nickname, lesson
     A*                                     prose only): a load-all subfile
     A*                                     listing JUCHUM (order#/
     A*                                     customer code/date/rep),
     A*                                     PLUS a JUNM column (customer
     A*                                     name), filled by the RPG
     A*                                     side (src/qrpglesrc/
     A*                                     f0702bs.rpgle, object
     A*                                     F0702B) calling JUCSRV's
     A*                                     getCustName for every row.
     A*                                     Part 7, lesson 07-02,
     A*                                     ADVANCED/OPTIONAL exercise
     A*                                     (not part of 07-02's own
     A*                                     mandatory verification -
     A*                                     see work/design/decisions-
     A*                                     2026-09.md, entry P7-9, and
     A*                                     the lesson's own real-
     A*                                     hardware notes section).
     A*
     A*                                     STATUS: V1-only (compile-
     A*                                     check), NOT YET compiled on
     A*                                     real hardware - a future
     A*                                     connection will confirm
     A*                                     this. Interactive subfile/
     A*                                     EXFMT execution is V3
     A*                                     (learner's own 5250 session)
     A*                                     regardless, same as every
     A*                                     other WORKSTN file in this
     A*                                     repo.
     A*
     A*                                     STRUCTURAL TEMPLATE: this
     A*                                     file is a close copy of
     A*                                     src/qddssrc/d0611s.dspf
     A*                                     (D0611A, 06-11) - same
     A*                                     DSPSIZ/SFL/SFLCTL/SFL1FTR
     A*                                     shape, same column
     A*                                     positions for JUNO/JUTOK/
     A*                                     JUDATE/JUTAN, same
     A*                                     OVERLAY/CPD7812 footer
     A*                                     split (a SFLCTL record
     A*                                     cannot carry positioned
     A*                                     output both above and below
     A*                                     its own subfile - see
     A*                                     d0611s.dspf's own header for
     A*                                     the confirmed real-hardware
     A*                                     fix this file reuses
     A*                                     unchanged). Per the P7-9
     A*                                     decision, this exercise
     A*                                     deliberately drops what
     A*                                     D0611A has that this one
     A*                                     does not need:
     A*                                     - OPT (row-selection field)
     A*                                     and its "5=order inquiry"
     A*                                     column - this exercise's
     A*                                     whole point is a SECOND real
     A*                                     caller of getCustName, not
     A*                                     option-5 machinery.
     A*                                     - MSGSFL/MSGCTL (message
     A*                                     subfile) - with no OPT
     A*                                     field there is no invalid-
     A*                                     option case to report.
     A*                                     Everything else (SFLSIZ/
     A*                                     SFLPAG/SFLDSP/SFLDSPCTL/
     A*                                     ROLLUP/ROLLDOWN/CF03/
     A*                                     OVERLAY, the load-all
     A*                                     strategy, the unconditioned-
     A*                                     SFLDSP + always-write-at-
     A*                                     least-one-row discipline) is
     A*                                     unchanged from D0611A - see
     A*                                     that file's own header for
     A*                                     the full rationale, not
     A*                                     repeated here.
     A*
     A*                                     ADDED: JUNM (30A, output-
     A*                                     only, not an external
     A*                                     JUCHUM field - screen-only,
     A*                                     same "not tied to any DB
     A*                                     file" status D0611A's own
     A*                                     OPT field had). f0702bs.rpgle
     A*                                     fills it explicitly (JUNM =
     A*                                     getCustName(jutok)) before
     A*                                     each WRITE, since - unlike
     A*                                     JUNO/JUTOK/JUDATE/JUTAN -
     A*                                     there is no same-named
     A*                                     JUCHUM field for WORKSTN/DB
     A*                                     auto-match to fill it from.
     A*
     A*                                     NO DDS CONDITIONING
     A*                                     INDICATORS anywhere in this
     A*                                     file, same policy as
     A*                                     D0611A/tk0100d.dspf (see
     A*                                     those files' own headers).
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A          R SFL1                      SFL
     A            JUNO           6A  O  4  5
     A            JUTOK          6A  O  4 13
     A            JUDATE         8S 0O  4 21
     A            JUTAN          6A  O  4 31
     A            JUNM          30A  O  4 41
     A          R SFL1CTL                   SFLCTL(SFL1)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(9999)
     A                                      SFLPAG(14)
     A                                      SFLDSP
     A                                      SFLDSPCTL
     A                                      ROLLUP(25)
     A                                      ROLLDOWN(26)
     A                                      CF03(03)
     A*                                     OVERLAY: see D0611A's own
     A*                                     header (CPD7812 fix) -
     A*                                     SFL1CTL carries only the
     A*                                     top header here; the footer
     A*                                     lives in SFL1FTR below.
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                  1  2'JUCLST4 (JUCSRV) - Order list'
     A                                  3  5'Order#'
     A                                  3 13'Cust'
     A                                  3 21'Date'
     A                                  3 31'Rep'
     A                                  3 41'Name'
     A*                                     SFL1FTR: split out of
     A*                                     SFL1CTL above, same
     A*                                     CPD7812 fix as D0611A. MORE:
     A*                                     f0702bs.rpgle MOVELs
     A*                                     'BOTTOM' here (load-all has
     A*                                     nothing left to fetch),
     A*                                     same technique as D0611A.
     A          R SFL1FTR
     A            MORE          10A  O 20  2
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit  Roll=Page'
